---
import chatPointer from '../assets/images/chat-pointer.svg';
import selfPortrait from '../assets/images/self-portrait.gif';
---

<section
    id="hero"
    class="hero"
>
    <h1 class="hero__title">I love <span>games</span>,<br/><span>software</span> and <span>tech</span>.<br/>And I like to <span>build</span> cool stuff.</h1>

    <div class="hero__intro">
        <div class="hero__chat">
            <div class="hero__chat-box">
                <p class="hero__chat-text">Hi, my name is <span>Marga López</span>. Nice to meet you!</p>
                <p class="hero__chat-text">I’m a <span>Senior Software Engineer</span> with more than 10 years of experience in the field and am now <s>multiclassing</s> exploring <span>Game Dev</span>. I’m based in Spain, and amongst coding I also love <span>cats</span>, <span>food</span> and <span>plants</span>. My magical country to visit is <span>Japan</span>, as I really enjoy manga and anime, but also its architecture and culture, which had me fascinated growing up as a kid.</p>
                <p class="hero__chat-text">Back then, I’d also spend hours <span>drawing</span> my favourite characters, and I’m slowly getting back into this passion by creating digital art – I’m really enjoying <span>pixel art</span>, if you hadn't already noticed :).</p>
            </div>
            <img
                class="hero__chat-pointer"
                src={chatPointer.src}
                alt="Chat pointer"
            />
        </div>

        <img
            class="hero__image"
            src={selfPortrait.src}
            alt="Marga López"
        />
    </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
    .hero {
        @apply layout pt-section;

        &__title {
            @apply lg:text-right lg:text-7xl text-5xl;
        }

        &__intro {
            @apply mt-section flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-end justify-between;
        }

        &__chat {
            @apply mb-4 md:mb-section flex flex-col md:flex-row items-end;

            &-box {
                @apply p-6 rounded-lg rounded-br-none bg-boxes;
            }

            &-pointer {
                @apply mr-3px mt--3px md:mx-0 md:mt-0 md:mb--1px transform rotate-90 md:rotate-0;
            }

            &-text {
                span {
                    @apply text-secondary;
                }
            }
        }

        &__image {
            @apply w-full max-w-60 md:w-69 md:min-w-69 md:h-69;
        }
    }
</style>